---
description: Final Table v3 design system — tokens, components and UI rules for any Flutter UI work
globs: lib/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

Before writing or changing UI, read @design_tokens/AI_GUIDE.md and follow it.
Full rules: @design_tokens/guidelines/00-overview.md and the other files in
design_tokens/guidelines/. Component specs: @design_tokens/guidelines/07-components.md.

Non-negotiables:
- v3 code uses only Ft* tokens: context.ftColors, FtTextStyles, FtSpacing, FtRadius, FtSize — no Color(0x…), AppColors, GoogleFonts or numeric paddings.
- Use v3 widgets from lib/design_system/components/v3/ (FtButton, …); build a missing one there first.
- Never mix v3 and old App* styling on one screen.
- 44pt tap targets; one prominent green action per screen; results signed with + / − (U+2212).
- Dark and Light must both work; strings via AppLocalizations.
- Finish with flutter analyze, flutter test test/design_system/, python3 tool/design_lint.py.
- Each change on its own branch from design_v2, PR into design_v2 — never push to design_v2 or main.
